title: "facem2lod: FACEM ceramic fabrics as Linked Open Data"
abstract: >-
  Python pipeline that harvests the fabric descriptions of the FACEM database
  (facem.at) and models them as Linked Open Data with CIDOC CRM and its
  extensions, bridged to the geo-lod palaeoclimate model.
type: software
